The repository contains the following files:

Data:

1. Data_eleSubset_PollSubset_R.csv

This dataset contains pollinator observations made in two time periods on Pikes Peak that meet the following criteria:
- Observed pollinator was identified to species level
- Pollinator species was observed in both the past and present
- At least 3 individuals of the pollinator species were observed in each time period
- In the present, the pollinator was observed between 2300 and 2900 meters of elevation

Variables:
Poll_spec: The species name of the observed pollinator species
Poll_order: The name of the order the observed pollinator species belongs to
Julian_day: The Julian day (day of the year) that the pollinator was observed
Plant_spec: The species name of the plant the pollinator was observed on
Freq: The frequency of the observed plant-pollinator interaction
Period: The time period where an observation was made (2 levels: "Past" and "Present")

2. Data_eleSubset_PlantSubset_R.csv

This dataset contains 
plant observations made in two time periods on Pikes Peak that meet the following criteria:
- Observed plant was identified to species level
- Plant species was observed in both the past and present
- At least 3 individuals of the plant species were observed in each time period
- In the present, the plant was observed between 2300 and 2900 meters of elevation

Variables:
Poll_spec: The species name of the observed pollinator species
Poll_order: The name of the order the observed pollinator species belongs to
Julian_day: The Julian day (day of the year) that the pollinator was observed
Plant_spec: The species name of the plant the pollinator was observed on
Freq: The frequency of the observed plant-pollinator interaction
Period: The time period where an observation was made (2 levels: "Past" and "Present")

3. Pres.csv

This dataset contains all present observations before filtering for the criteria described above.

Variables:
Poll_spec: The species name of the observed pollinator species
Poll_order: The name of the order the observed pollinator species belongs to
Julian_day: The Julian day (day of the year) that the pollinator was observed
Plant_spec: The species name of the plant the pollinator was observed on
Freq: The frequency of the observed plant-pollinator interaction
Ele_m: The elevation (in meters) where the observation was made
Lat: The latitude where and observation was made
Lon: The longitude where and observation was made
Period: The time period where an observation was made (1 level: "Present")

Code:

1. REVISED_Zoller_et_al_AmNat_main.R
This script contains code for reproducing the analyses and figures presented in the manuscript.
2. REVISED_Zoller_et_al_AmNat_supplement.R
This script contains code for reproducing the analyses and figures presented in the supplementary material.
The authors recommend to first ruin the main file, followed by the supplement file.

